{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774053154,"nonce":"x1UfSSoDp/xIwn1To36TohrwSAs=","title":"Partition A: Backend — preset data model, API, parser, union, SDK integration","message":"All server-side work for the Presets feature:\n\n**Data model migration** (new migration in src/db.ts):\n- presets table: id TEXT PK, name, description, source (manual|claude_md_global|claude_md_project|claude_md_local), source_path, content_hash, version INTEGER, timestamps\n- preset_nodes table: id, preset_id FK, parent_id FK self, position, title, body, level, timestamps\n- session_presets table: session_id, preset_id, preset_version, position (pill ordering)\n- preset_diffs table: id, session_id, preset_id, node_id, diff_type (add|remove|modify), old_content, new_content, status (proposed|accepted|rejected|promoted), timestamps\n\n**CRUD API** (new src/routes/presets.ts):\n- GET/POST /api/presets, GET/PUT/DELETE /api/presets/:id\n- GET/PUT /api/presets/:id/nodes (tree operations)\n- PATCH /api/presets/:id/nodes/reorder (nodeId, newParentId, newPosition)\n- GET/POST/DELETE /api/console/sessions/:id/presets\n- GET /api/presets/union?session_id=X (compute union text + token estimate)\n\n**Markdown parser/serializer** (new src/presets.ts):\n- Parse MD to node tree: split on heading lines, heading text → title, content → body, depth → level, stack for parent tracking\n- Serialize node tree to MD: recursive, ## prefix from level, body below heading\n- Round-trip invariant: serialize(parse(md)) === md\n- Pre-heading content → synthetic root node (title: \"\", level: 0)\n\n**Union engine** (in src/presets.ts):\n- Given N preset IDs: flatten leaf nodes, content-hash dedup, order by pill position then tree position\n- Token estimation: ~1 token per 3.5 chars\n- Return concatenated text + token count\n\n**SDK integration** (modify src/backends/sdk-backend.ts):\n- buildQueryOptions(): accept presetIds, resolve union, inject via systemPrompt\n- Override settingSources to exclude sources covered by active presets (e.g., exclude \"user\" when claude_md_global preset is active)\n- Extend SDKBackendOptions type with presetIds and settingSources override\n\n**Session plumbing** (modify src/routes/console.ts):\n- createConsoleSession: accept presetIds in request body, store in session_presets, pass to SDKBackendOptions\n- PATCH options: accept preset changes, recompute union\n\n**Convention Library endpoint:**\n- GET /api/presets/library?q=\u003csearch\u003e\u0026limit=100\u0026offset=0\n- Derived view: query leaf nodes (no children) across all presets, dedup by content hash, full-text search on title+body\n\n**Export/import endpoints:**\n- GET /api/presets/:id/export → Markdown with front-matter (name, version)\n- POST /api/presets/import → parse MD with front-matter, create/update preset\n\n**CLAUDE.md import:**\n- Parse ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md by heading structure\n- Create read-only preset with source: claude_md_global\n- Drift detection via content_hash comparison\n\n**Workflow violation detection hook** (backend part):\n- PostToolUse-style hook in SDK backend detecting anomalous workflow behavior\n- Emit preset:violation SSE event with context (repo, tool, convention text)\n- Spawn remediation sub-agent producing preset_diff rows\n\n**Promotion policy settings:**\n- workflow_fix_policy setting (chat_only|review|auto_apply)\n- default_preset_ids setting (JSON array)\n- preset_token_warn_threshold setting\n\n**Routing algorithm** (in src/presets.ts):\n- Jaccard similarity on bag-of-words between fix text and preset nodes\n- Repo-specific signal: prefer claude_md_project preset matching the repo\n- Fallback: default manual preset\n- Return recommended_preset_id, confidence, reason\n\nBug: 877ab44","files":null}]}